    "description": "Perfect for those entering the market, as well as young and growing families, this home's street-facing position and enough space for everyone offers broad appeal to buyers searching for convenience, and a desire for low maintenance living. <br/>Set behind a white picket fence, the home opens past a separate sitting room which is positioned to enjoy the greenery of the well-maintained front garden. Open plan living spaces flow from lounge to dining, overlooked by the ample kitchen with a corner pantry, and sliding doors from the dining area open to a covered area just perfect for enjoying the warmer weather.<br/>Upstairs, three spacious bedrooms (all with built-in robes) share the central bathroom which offers a separate shower and bathtub. Features throughout the home include ducted heating, split systems in the living and main bedroom, large under-stair storage, downstairs powder room, and gated private driveway to the lock up carport.<br/>Positioned a ten-minute stroll from West Street, with supermarket, eateries and specialty stores, central Glenroy is equally accessible with bus stops a short walk away. Primary and Secondary schools, the Northern Golf Course and beautiful reserves are all conveniently close by, and for the city commuters it's about a 14km drive.",
