    "propertyType": "House",
    "description": "Set within proximity to the lively heart of Doreen and its well-regarded family amenities, this striking double-storey residence offers an ideal fusion of space, style and functionality, perfectly suited to contemporary family living.<br/>The thoughtfully designed floorplan unfolds to reveal multiple living zones that cater equally to everyday comfort and effortless entertaining, with well-considered accommodation ensuring privacy and balance throughout the home.<br/>The centrepiece of the residence is a beautifully finished kitchen, featuring a generous island bench, quality appliances and a spacious walk-in pantry. Overlooking a sunlit open-plan living and dining area, this space seamlessly connects via sliding doors to a versatile alfresco zone combining covered and open areas-perfect for entertaining in every season. There is a guest bedroom that comes with an ensuite. A separate lounge adds flexibility, providing an inviting retreat for quiet relaxation.<br/>Upstairs, a further living area forms a central hub and accompanies a well-appointed two master bedrooms, one complete with a walk-in robe, balcony, dual-vanity ensuite and refined finishes. Two additional bedrooms, all fitted with built-in robes, are serviced by a stylish family bathroom.<br/>Complementing the home is a range of quality inclusions, such as ducted heating and cooling, NBN connectivity, a guest powder room, and a remote double garage with internal access.<br/>Ideally positioned near quality public and private schools, parklands, Mernda Station and an array of local shopping destinations including Mernda Town Centre, Laurimar Town Centre and Riverstone Village, this impressive home presents a superb opportunity to secure comfort, convenience and versatility for every stage of family life.<br/>",
